        "name": "Unraveled Earth",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Taliyah creates a slowing minefield. If enemies dash through it or are knocked through it, the mines explode and stun them.",
        "bodyHtml": "Taliyah scatters loose stones in an area, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies hit by 20% and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/105/150/195/240 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The stones detonate when enemies dash or are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked</span> through them, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> for the remaining movement duration + 0.75 seconds and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/40/55/70/85 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The stun's duration cannot exceed 2 seconds. Each enemy can only be stunned once per cast. Monsters are always stunned for the maximum duration.<br />Stones beyond the first one deal 25% less damage. <br />Max detonation damage: <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(62.5/100/137.5/175/212.5 + (75% Ability Power))</span><br />This ability deals 225% damage to monsters.</span>",
