        "bodyHtml": "Taliyah creates a massive earthen wall for 4 seconds. If she immediately <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recasts</span>, she will ride along the wall as it unravels. Moving or being immobilized will end the ride.<br /><br />This ability cannot be cast if Taliyah has taken damage from Champions or structures within the last 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Once the wall is fully formed, Taliyah can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to destroy it early.</span>",
